 " is the association of the defining identities of an involutive bi-Lie \
algebra, each carrying its arity and the function computing its \
obstruction.",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"3edb4fca-ecbf-4e5c-a53f-67425983fae6"],

